  "system": {
    "identifier": "falling-blade",
    "description": "<p>You perform a single Powerful downward slash that slices through just about everything in your path. Make a melee taijutsu attack. On a hit, you deal your [Weapons damage] + 3d10 and the affected creature must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining 2 of Bleed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: On a failed save, they also gain 1 rank of Weakened.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: If the affected creature has ranks of a Mental condition, you make the attack with a +2 bonus to hit.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d10.</p>",
